  "claim_boundary": "This V2 audit corrects the source objective by charging every sensing decision its registered probe cost and evaluates a declared support-miss sensitivity grid. The epsilon values and unknown-loss box are assumptions, not estimates. Repetitions 1 and 2 are source-only; repetition 3 remains numerically closed. A positive source gate can justify only a separately reviewed held-repetition protocol. The recorded interaction trajectories are separate executions in a material/repetition block, so any probe-then-action interpretation requires reset and block-exchangeability assumptions and is not an online within-episode robot demonstration."
